WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.501 --> 00:00:02.295
(meows)

00:00:02.295 --> 00:00:03.627
(screams)

00:00:03.627 --> 00:00:08.627
(bouncy piano music)

00:00:11.635 --> 00:00:13.639
- Am I looking forward to
tasting some chocolate?

00:00:13.639 --> 00:00:15.298
Of course! It's chocolate.

00:00:15.298 --> 00:00:20.192
(bouncy piano music)

00:00:20.192 --> 00:00:21.251
(upbeat techno music)

00:00:21.251 --> 00:00:23.060
- Why is it wrapped like a present?

00:00:25.190 --> 00:00:25.890
(meows)

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:27.820
(gasps)

00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:30.281
- Oh my God!

00:00:30.281 --> 00:00:31.449
(laughs)

00:00:31.449 --> 00:00:32.523
- It's a kitten!

00:00:32.523 --> 00:00:33.827
- Oh my God, it's kittens!

00:00:33.827 --> 00:00:35.578
Oh my God, it's kittens!

00:00:35.578 --> 00:00:36.611
(squeals)

00:00:36.611 --> 00:00:39.081
- What? This is the best day of my life!

00:00:39.081 --> 00:00:41.125
- Oh, this isn't chocolate!

00:00:41.125 --> 00:00:42.632
- Oh my God, hello!

00:00:47.062 --> 00:00:49.123
- This is so much better than chocolate.

00:00:49.123 --> 00:00:51.260
- Oh my God, these are so precious!

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:53.262
- Oh, you're making noises!

00:00:53.262 --> 00:00:55.922
- Oh, he's so small!

00:00:55.922 --> 00:00:59.352
- I care so little about
chocolate right now.

00:00:59.352 --> 00:01:01.062
- They're so fuzzy!

00:01:01.062 --> 00:01:02.723
- Where's his tail? Oh, he does have one.

00:01:02.730 --> 00:01:03.888
I thought he didn't have a tail.

00:01:03.888 --> 00:01:05.745
- You are mine and we are leaving.

00:01:05.745 --> 00:01:08.145
(bouncy piano music)

00:01:08.145 --> 00:01:09.995
- Cats are the best. (laughs)

00:01:10.245 --> 00:01:12.407
If you bite the mic, we
can't use this audio.

00:01:12.407 --> 00:01:15.743
- Cats are great because you
work for their attention,

00:01:15.743 --> 00:01:18.694
but they also will love
you so unconditionally.

00:01:18.694 --> 00:01:21.676
- We hold dogs up as
being man's best friend.

00:01:22.066 --> 00:01:23.668
There are a lot of cats that can give you

00:01:23.668 --> 00:01:25.086
just as much love and that need homes.

00:01:25.086 --> 00:01:26.193
- You just gotta find a cat that's

00:01:26.193 --> 00:01:27.068
catered to your personality.

00:01:27.068 --> 00:01:28.460
If you want a chill
cat, they're out there.

00:01:28.470 --> 00:01:31.050
If you want a little demon like
this guy, they're out there.

00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:33.543
- There's so many cats in
shelters that need homes,

00:01:33.543 --> 00:01:36.180
so if you can, you should
foster them or adopt them.

00:01:36.180 --> 00:01:37.171
- Any time I open a box,

00:01:37.171 --> 00:01:38.725
I'm hoping that there are kittens in it

00:01:38.725 --> 00:01:40.092
and this time it was true.

00:01:40.092 --> 00:01:41.603
- I'll take all of them, don't worry.

00:01:41.603 --> 00:01:43.563
I'll have all the cats. (laughs)

00:01:43.563 --> 00:01:44.313
Ow!

00:01:44.313 --> 00:01:45.731
- I like to wrestle with my cats...

00:01:45.731 --> 00:01:48.026
with my hands, you know, not my full body.

00:01:48.026 --> 00:01:50.445
I'm not a maniac.

00:01:51.779 --> 00:01:52.686
(meows)

